							Import-ready spices are offered in wholesale formats with lot-level documentation and quality notes shared during sampling and contracting.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="mt-8 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
						{spiceCatalogue.map((spice) => (
							<article class="rounded-2xl border border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02] p-6 text-sm text-slate-200 shadow-xl shadow-black/25">
								<h4 class="text-lg font-semibold text-white">{spice.name}</h4>
								<dl class="mt-4 space-y-3">
									<div>
										<dt class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-slate-300/80">Description</dt>
