			<section id="delivery-payment" class="border-t border-white/10 bg-[#0a152a] py-20">
				<div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 lg:px-8">
					<div class="max-w-3xl">
						<p class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.4em] text-amber-300/70">Delivery & Payment</p>
						<h2 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-white sm:text-4xl">Clear delivery terms and flexible payment options</h2>
						<p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-300">
							Delivery and payment are agreed per order based on shipment size, timeline, and destination requirements.
